Description: Official Looping Runtime, Compiler & Engine for Shine Loop Console
 Looping is a high-performance declarative programming language and
 multimedia game engine developed by Holo Entertainment & Coki Studios.
 .
 Features include:
  - 60 FPS low-latency canvas viewport & UI subsystem (Frosted Aqua A17)
  - Bi-directional Python 3 bridge (Zero-copy NumPy/SciPy interop)
  - Ruuping native Rust compiler integration
  - Shine Loop Console & Holo Looping OoS 1.0 subsystem targeting
  - Interactive REPL and instant APK/HTML5 packaging
